1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,500
Welcome to VidyaDwaar, an enterprise-grade academic data
and credential integrity ecosystem for the Smart India Hackathon.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:14,000
VidyaDwaar establishes an APAAR-based student data management
and verification platform for higher education.

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:19,500
Uniting institutions, regulatory authorities,
and students on a single secure trust registry.

4
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:27,000
Across thousands of institutions, student records remain heavily
fragmented across legacy ERPs and paper filings.

5
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:35,000
This creates severe challenges: ghost colleges, unmonitored intake,
duplicate enrolments across states, and forged certificates.

6
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:44,500
VidyaDwaar eliminates these critical vulnerabilities
through automated, privacy-preserving verification.

7
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:51,500
VidyaDwaar enforces strict role-based access control
across five distinct user roles.

8
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Students access only their personal academic records,
while institutional administrators manage authorized student admissions.

9
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:06,500
Registrars administer formal records, and AICTE regulators
monitor national intake compliance and institutional risk.

10
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:14,500
External verifiers receive controlled, privacy-preserving access
without exposing unauthorized student data.

11
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:22,500
Here is the active Institution Dashboard for Vidyapeeth Institute
of Technology and Science in Bengaluru.

12
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:30,500
Officials inspect their approved intake of 120 seats,
current enrolment of 60 students, and branch-wise utilisation.

13
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:39,500
High Data Quality Scores of 94.2 and real-time validation alerts
ensure complete regulatory compliance.

14
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:46,500
For students, VidyaDwaar delivers complete self-sovereign control
over their academic identity.

15
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:54,500
Logging in with their APAAR ID, student Aarav Sharma accesses
verified enrolments, institution details, and status.

16
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Students independently review employer consent requests
and inspect full audit access transparency logs.

17
00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:09,500
Direct academic grievances can be submitted
without unnecessary administrative friction.

18
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:18,500
VidyaDwaar also provides an offline-capable Android application
for students across India.

19
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:25,500
Enabling access to supported locally available academic records
and downloaded certificates even when internet is unavailable.

20
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:29,500
Offline SQLite storage allows instant presentation
of verified credentials in remote areas.

21
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:37,000
Within the Student Credential Wallet, students can open
and download W3C Verifiable Credentials.

22
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:45,000
Each certificate features university seals and an Ed25519-signed
Base45 QR code for instant scanning.

23
00:02:45,500 --> 00:02:54,500
Students save the tamper-evident certificate locally as a demo sample
or print it for instant verification.

24
00:02:55,500 --> 00:03:02,500
When institutions submit student batch rosters,
VidyaDwaar executes instant APAAR validation and cross-matching.

25
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:11,000
When duplicate identifiers or concurrent enrolments occur,
an explainable case is flagged in the AICTE resolution queue.

26
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:20,000
Crucially, matching identifiers trigger human investigation
rather than an automatic fraud decision.

27
00:03:20,500 --> 00:03:29,500
Administrators compare side-by-side institutional evidence
and resolve discrepancies with complete auditability.

28
00:03:30,500 --> 00:03:37,000
At the regulatory level, AICTE officials command comprehensive oversight
across 4,120 institutions and 82,410 enrolled students.

29
00:03:37,500 --> 00:03:45,000
Administrators monitor state-by-state seat intake quotas,
excess enrolment rankings, and risk inspection priorities.

30
00:03:45,500 --> 00:03:52,500
Automated analytics highlight shared student clusters
and potential regulatory compliance breaches.

31
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:59,500
Direct credential verification connects seamlessly
with the national cryptographic trust registry.

32
00:04:00,500 --> 00:04:07,500
VidyaDwaar combines a responsive React TypeScript frontend
with an asynchronous Python FastAPI backend engine.

33
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:15,000
Data integrity is enforced via PostgreSQL with Row-Level Security
and offline SQLite client caching.

34
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:22,500
Security is rooted in zero-knowledge blind indexing for privacy
and W3C Ed25519 cryptographic signatures.

35
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:29,500
Tamper-evident audit logging tracks every query,
ensuring complete transparency and institutional trust.

36
00:04:30,500 --> 00:04:37,500
In summary, VidyaDwaar unifies fragmented academic data
and eliminates unmonitored duplicate admissions.

37
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:45,000
Empowering students with direct digital credential ownership
and offline-capable verifiable certificates.

38
00:04:45,500 --> 00:04:51,500
Providing regulators and institutions with explainable,
real-time governance across India.

39
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:59,500
VidyaDwaar — Making Academic Records More Reliable,
Verifiable and Transparent.

